SocksPort 9050

# The control port is a full control channel: SETCONF, circuit listing, hidden
# services. Without an auth method Tor answers AUTH METHODS=NULL and any local
# user gets that control for free.
# The cookie lands in ~/.tor/control_auth_cookie as 0600, so this shuts out other
# local users. Code already running as this user can still read it and connect.
ControlPort 9051
CookieAuthentication 1
